+# USDC Staker
+
+Stake USDC on Base and withdraw the full position at any time. No rewards, no admin keys.
+
+- Contract: `packages/hardhat/contracts/Staker.sol` (tests: `yarn hardhat:test`)
+- Page: `/stake` (`packages/nextjs/app/stake`)
+- Local dev: `yarn chain`, `yarn deploy`, `yarn start`. Locally, `MockUSDC` (6 decimals, pause/blacklist like Circle's FiatToken) is deployed under the name `USDC`; mint yourself test USDC from the Debug Contracts page.
+
+## Launch checklist (Base)
+
+1. `yarn generate` (or `yarn account:import`), fund the deployer with a little ETH on Base.
+2. `yarn deploy --network base` — deploys `Staker` against real USDC `0x833589fCD6eDb6E08f4c7C32D4f71b54bdA02913`.
+3. `yarn verify --network base`.
+4. In `packages/nextjs/scaffold.config.ts` set `targetNetworks: [chains.base]`.
+5. Set env vars in the hosting provider: `NEXT_PUBLIC_ALCHEMY_API_KEY` (own key, not the shared default), `NEXT_PUBLIC_WALLET_CONNECT_PROJECT_ID`, and `NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL` if not on Vercel.
+6. Replace `packages/nextjs/public/thumbnail.jpg` and `favicon.png` (still Scaffold-ETH branding).
+7. Get `Staker.sol` reviewed/audited before accepting significant deposits.
+
+---
+
